  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food system transformation to ensure inclusive economic growth and to improve food and nutrition security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO is taking part in the &quot;Food system transformation to ensure inclusive economic growth and improved food and nutrition security&quot; component of the joint UN programme in Zanzibar. The project is aligned to the PCP for Tanzania, in particular the component on sustainable value chains and value addition for agro value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
